sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant AS as Auth Service

    note over User, AS: 1 — Signup
    User->>GW: Sign Up { username, password, role }
    GW->>AS: signup { username, password, role }

    alt role not in [client, driver]
        AS-->>GW: Invalid role
        GW-->>User: Invalid role
    else username already exists
        AS-->>GW: User already exists
        GW-->>User: User already exists
    else username available
        AS-->>GW: User created successfully
        GW-->>User: User created successfully
    end

    note over User, AS: 2 — Login
    User->>GW: Log In { username, password }
    GW->>AS: login { username, password }

    alt user not found or wrong password
        AS-->>GW: Invalid credentials
        GW-->>User: Invalid credentials
    else credentials valid
        AS-->>GW: { accessToken, refreshToken }
        GW-->>User: { accessToken, refreshToken }
        note right of GW: All subsequent requests include Bearer token
    end

    note over User, AS: 3 — Authenticated Requests
    User->>GW: Authenticated Request
    alt token invalid or expired
        GW-->>User: Invalid or expired token
    else token valid
        GW->>GW: proxy to target service
    end
